# Tables Demo

## Simple Table

| Name  | Age | City    |
|-------|-----|---------|
| Ali   | 30  | Tehran  |
| Sara  | 25  | London  |
| Reza  | 35  | Paris   |

## Table with Alignment

| Left      | Center | Right |
|:----------|:------:|------:|
| Apple     | 10     | $5    |
| Banana    | 20     | $10   |
| Cherry    | 15     | $7.5  |

## Table with Formatting

| Feature        | Status | Notes          |
|----------------|:------:|----------------|
| **Bold**       | ✅     | Works          |
| *Italic*       | ✅     | Works          |
| `Code`         | ✅     | Works          |
| [Link](https://example.com) | ✅ | Works |

## Table with Numbers

| Metric    | Q1    | Q2    | Q3    |
|:----------|------:|------:|------:|
| Revenue   | 12000 | 15000 | 18000 |
| Users     | 340   | 520   | 780   |
| Growth    | +12%  | +53%  | +50%  |

